        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions AP-GDP625SBR, Bamboo Refrigerator Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Bamboo Appliance Pull was molded from a real piece of bamboo and cast in solid brass. Choose from a huge array of finishes to match your existing hardware or to inspire your dream kitchen. This Guadalupe Handle can be mounted on any standard appliance panel, be it on the refrigerator, the freezer, or even the dishwasher. Choose from either an 11-3/4 inch length or a 17-3/4 inch length. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the First Impressions AP-GDP625SBR Guadalupe Refrigerator Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-GDP-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262217\"><b>First Impressions AP-GDP625SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>AP-GDP625011SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 11-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.09\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-GDP625017SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 17-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 11-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.13\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is hand assembled in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Bamboo Appliance Pull",
                "description": "The Bamboo Appliance Pull was molded from a real piece of bamboo and cast in solid brass. Choose from a huge array of finishes to match your existing hardware or to inspire your dream kitchen. This Guadalupe Handle can be mounted on any standard appliance panel, be it on the refrigerator, the freezer, or even the dishwasher. Choose from either an 11-3/4 inch length or a 17-3/4 inch length. \r\n",
